{% comment %}
  Wholesale orders page (templates/page.comenzi-engross.json). A precise, "project
  quote" page, deliberately unlike the showroom, company, B2B and creator pages:

  - Hero: headline + a quote document for a 48-room hotel, built from real products
    (list prices live, wholesale prices locked "on request").
  - Proof row (the product count is live), who it is for, why buy direct, the four
    steps, and a four-step quote request (assets/alc-engross.js) that goes to the
    store's contact inbox tagged "Comanda en-gros". Without JavaScript the four steps
    show as one form.

  Every storefront language has a built-in translation. Styles: assets/alc-engross.css.
{% endcomment %}
